---
// Panel 2: a strip of paper that pulls the colours of a leaf apart.
import { bands, strength } from '../../lib/leaves';
---

<div class="tool" data-paper-tool>
  <svg class="strip" viewBox="0 0 220 260" role="img" aria-label="A strip of paper with bands of colour at different heights" data-paper-svg>
    <rect class="paper" x="70" y="20" width="80" height="220" rx="3"></rect>
    <rect class="liquid" data-paper-liquid x="70" y="240" width="80" height="0"></rect>
    <line class="start" x1="64" y1="216" x2="156" y2="216"></line>
    <g data-paper-bands>
      {bands.map((b, i) => <rect class="band" data-band={i} x="76" y={216 - b.height * 190 - 5} width="68" height="12" rx="6" fill={b.colour} style={`opacity: ${strength.summer[i]}`}></rect>)}
    </g>
  </svg>
  <div class="controls needs-js" role="group" aria-label="Which leaf">
    <button type="button" class="btn fill" data-paper-leaf="summer" aria-pressed="true">A summer leaf</button>
    <button type="button" class="btn" data-paper-leaf="autumn" aria-pressed="false">An autumn leaf</button>
  </div>
  <div class="controls needs-js">
    <label class="field">
      <span>The liquid has climbed <output data-paper-out>100 per cent</output></span>
      <input class="range" type="range" min="0" max="100" step="1" value="100" data-paper-range aria-label="How far the liquid has climbed the paper" />
    </label>
  </div>
  <p class="status" aria-live="polite" data-paper-status>
    On the summer leaf the two chlorophyll bands are strong. Carotene, the yellow orange band, travels farthest.
  </p>
  <table class="times">
    <caption class="sr-only">The bands on the paper from the top</caption>
    <thead><tr><th scope="col">Band, from the top</th><th scope="col">Colour</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr><th scope="row">Carotene</th><td>yellow orange</td></tr>
      <tr><th scope="row">Xanthophyll</th><td>yellow</td></tr>
      <tr><th scope="row">Chlorophyll a</th><td>blue green</td></tr>
      <tr><th scope="row">Chlorophyll b</th><td>yellow green</td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
</div>
